Chinnereth
Numbers 34:11, Deuteronomy 3:17, Joshua 13:27, Joshua 19:35
Also Known As Kinnereth, Is A Town And A Region Near The Sea Of Galilee, Also Called The Sea Of . It Is Mentioned In Numbers 34:11 And Deuteronomy 3:17As Part Of The Promised Land’S Boundaries.
259

Chinneroth
Joshua 11:2, Joshua 12:3
